# polski.strings — Polish translation for the `add_language` contribution.
#
# The engine stores string KEYS as hashes (it hashes the bracket name), so a made-up
# `[Menu.NewGame]` reverses to a hash the table never had. These are REAL keys from the
# shipped `english` table (via `stringdb_dump` over vz.wad), edited by hash. The workshop's
# Localization page is the real author of this file; these lines prove the pipeline.
